  "tha-ap477:1.1": "Esanāya carantassa ",
  "tha-ap477:1.2": "Vipassissa mahesino / ",
  "tha-ap477:1.3": "rittakaṃ pattaṃ disvāna ",
  "tha-ap477:1.4": "kummāsaṃ pūrayim ahaṃ. // // ",
  "tha-ap477:2.1": "Ekanavute ito kappe ",
  "tha-ap477:2.2": "yaṃ bhikkh*am adadiṃ tadā* / ",
  "tha-ap477:2.3": "duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi ",
  "tha-ap477:2.4": "kummāsassa idaṃ phalaṃ. // // ",
  "tha-ap477:3.1": "Kilesā . . . ",
  "tha-ap477:3.2": "pe . . . ",
  "tha-ap477:3.3": "",
  "tha-ap477:4.1": "",
  "tha-ap477:4.2": "pe . . . ",
  "tha-ap477:4.3": "pe . . . // // Sāgataṃ . . . pe . . . pe . . . pe . . . // // ",
  "tha-ap477:5.1": "Paṭisambhidā . . . ",
  "tha-ap477:5.2": "pe . . . ",
  "tha-ap477:5.3": "pe . . . pe . . . // // ",
  "tha-ap477:6.1": "Itthaṃ sudam āyasmā Kummāsadāyako thero i. g. a-ti. Kummāsadāyakattherassa apadānaṃ samattaṃ. ",
